WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.444 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:13.814
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.516
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.549 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.713
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.746 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.784
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:00.428 --> 01:03.164
Narrator
FISHERMEN HAVE QUITE AN EFFECT
旁白
渔民的影响相当大

01:03.197 --> 01:04.832
ON OUR UNDERSEA FRIENDS.
关于我们的海底朋友。

01:04.865 --> 01:08.336
Squidward:
SPONGEBOB, HAVE YOU FINISHED
SWABBING THE DECK?
章鱼哥：
海绵宝宝，你完成了吗
擦拭甲板？

01:08.369 --> 01:11.071
ALMOST. THERE'S A NASTY BARNACLE
UNDER TABLE NINE.
几乎。有一个讨厌的藤壶
在表九下面。

01:12.573 --> 01:14.575
THEY'RE BACK!
THEY'RE BACK, I TELL YOU!
他们回来了！
我告诉你，他们回来了！

01:14.608 --> 01:16.510
I SAW THEM WITH ME OWN EYES!
我亲眼看到他们！

01:16.544 --> 01:18.712
( all muttering )
（大家都在嘀咕）

01:18.746 --> 01:20.881
THE HOOKS! THE HOOKS!
钩子！钩子！

01:20.914 --> 01:22.683
HOW ABOUT A MINT?
薄荷糖怎么样？

01:22.716 --> 01:24.485
Krabs:
THE HOOKS!
THE HOOKS!
螃蟹：
钩子！
钩子！

01:24.518 --> 01:26.354
CAN YOU MAKE THAT TO GO?
你能做到吗？

01:26.387 --> 01:28.422
YOU DON'T KNOW
HOW LUCKY YOU ARE.
你不知道
你真幸运。

01:28.456 --> 01:29.623
THE HOOKS!
钩子！

01:29.657 --> 01:32.326
SO THERE I WAS,
MINDING MY OWN BUSINESS...
所以我就在那里，
管好自己的事...

01:32.360 --> 01:34.262
I'D LOVE TO HEAR
ANOTHER OF YOUR
我很想听
另一个你的

01:34.295 --> 01:35.863
RIVETING SEA TALES,
BUT, UM...
引人入胜的海洋故事，
但是，嗯...

01:35.896 --> 01:38.432
I HAVE TO DO
MY WASTEBASKET
INSPECTIONS.
我必须做
我的废纸篓
检查。

01:38.466 --> 01:40.768
UH-HUH... MM-HMM... OH, YEAH,
THERE'S ONE.
嗯嗯...嗯嗯...哦，是的，
有一个。

01:40.801 --> 01:43.271
FINE! DON'T SAY
I DIDN'T WARN YOU.
美好的！别说
我没有警告过你。

01:44.638 --> 01:47.308
WARN HIM ABOUT WHAT, MR. KRABS?
警告他注意什么，先生。螃蟹？

01:47.341 --> 01:49.343
THE HOOKS, ME BUCKO.
钩子，我是巴克。

01:49.377 --> 01:50.478
THEY'RE BACK.
他们回来了。

01:50.511 --> 01:52.246
BEWARE THE HOOKS.
小心钩子。

01:52.280 --> 01:53.647
THE HOOKS?
钩子？

01:53.681 --> 01:54.782
AYE, THE HOOKS.
是的，钩子。

01:54.815 --> 01:56.217
THEY DANGLE DOWN
它们垂下来

01:56.250 --> 01:57.285
AND DRAW YOU CLOSE
并吸引你靠近

01:57.318 --> 01:58.586
WITH THEIR
PLEASING SHAPES
与他们
赏心悦目的形状

01:58.619 --> 02:00.388
AND THEIR
BEGUILING COLORS.
和他们的
迷人的色彩。

02:00.421 --> 02:04.258
AND JUST WHEN YOU THINK YOU
FOUND THE LAND OF MILK AND HONEY
当你认为你
发现牛奶和蜂蜜之地

02:04.292 --> 02:07.595
THEY GRAB YOU BY THE BRITCHES
AND HAUL YOU WAY UP HIGH!
他们抓住你的裤子
并把你拉得很高！

02:07.628 --> 02:10.731
THEN HIGHER,
AND HIGHER,
AND HIGHER!
然后更高，
更高，
而且更高！

02:10.764 --> 02:12.766
UNTIL YOU'RE HAULED
UP TO THE SURFACE
直到你被拖走
深入表面

02:12.800 --> 02:14.435
FLOPPING AND GASPING
FOR BREATH.
扑腾和喘气
为了呼吸。

02:14.468 --> 02:17.605
AND THEN THEY COOK YOU
AND THEN THEY EAT YOU!
然后他们把你煮熟
然后他们就会吃掉你！

02:17.638 --> 02:18.572
OR WORSE...
或者更糟...

02:18.606 --> 02:20.508
WHAT COULD BE WORSE THAN THAT?!
还有什么比这更糟糕的呢？

02:20.541 --> 02:21.809
GIFT SHOPS.
礼品店。

02:24.278 --> 02:25.213
( gasps )
（喘气）

02:25.246 --> 02:26.947
DON'T LET IT GET ME, MR. KRABS.
别让它影响我，先生。螃蟹。

02:26.980 --> 02:29.483
THERE, THERE, BOY,
THEY WON'T GET YOU.
那里，那里，男孩，
他们不会抓到你的。

02:29.517 --> 02:32.353
NOT AS LONG AS YOU LISTEN
TO OLD MR. KRABS.
只要你听
致老先生。螃蟹。

02:32.386 --> 02:34.288
NOW GET BACK
TO THE KITCHEN!
现在回来
到厨房！

02:34.322 --> 02:36.324
AYE-AYE, MR. KRABS!
是啊，先生。螃蟹！

02:38.326 --> 02:40.428
GOOD MORNING,
KRUSTY CREW!
早上好，
克鲁斯蒂船员！

02:40.461 --> 02:41.395
HEY, PATRICK.
嘿，帕特里克。

02:41.429 --> 02:42.596
GUESS WHAT?
你猜怎么着？

02:42.630 --> 02:44.398
THE CARNIVAL'S IN TOWN.
嘉年华就在城里。

02:44.432 --> 02:45.633
COME ON, LET'S GO.
来吧，我们走吧。

02:45.666 --> 02:48.302
I CAN'T LEAVE NOW,
I'M WORKING.
我现在不能离开，
我正在工作。

02:48.336 --> 02:49.537
IT'S NOT LEAVING.
它不会离开。

02:49.570 --> 02:51.739
YOU'RE JUST
TAKING A BREAK.
你只是
休息一下。

02:54.842 --> 02:59.813
* WE'RE GOING TO THE CARNIVAL,
GOING TO THE CARNIV... OOF! *
*我们要去狂欢节，
去狂欢节……噢！ *

02:59.847 --> 03:04.418
* WE'RE GOING TO THE CARNIVAL,
GOING TO THE CARNIVAL. *
*我们要去狂欢节，
去狂欢节。 *

03:04.452 --> 03:05.886
THERE IT IS, SPONGEBOB.
就是这样，海绵宝宝。

03:05.919 --> 03:09.423
THE CARNIVAL IS
BACK IN TOWN!
嘉年华是
回到城里！

03:09.457 --> 03:12.326
I'M GOING TO BE FIRST IN LINE
FOR EVERYTHING!
我要排在第一个
为了一切！

03:12.360 --> 03:13.994
WHERE IS
EVERYBODY?
在哪里
大家？

03:14.027 --> 03:15.429
I DON'T KNOW.
我不知道。

03:15.463 --> 03:17.531
THERE WAS ONE KID
HERE EARLIER.
有一个孩子
早些时候在这里。

03:17.565 --> 03:19.833
DOESN'T LOOK LIKE
ANY CARNIVAL I EVER...
看起来不像
我参加过的任何嘉年华...

03:19.867 --> 03:21.369
( clink )
OH!
（叮当声）
哦！

03:21.402 --> 03:22.536
EXCUSE ME.
( gasps )
打扰一下。
（喘气）

03:23.904 --> 03:25.806
STOP, PATRICK!
DON'T TOUCH IT.
停下来，帕特里克！
不要碰它。

03:25.839 --> 03:27.308
THIS ISN'T THE CARNIVAL.
这不是嘉年华。

03:27.341 --> 03:28.642
THOSE ARE HOOKS!
这些是钩子！

03:28.676 --> 03:30.511
MR. KRABS SAYS
THEY'RE REALLY DANGEROUS!
先生。蟹蟹说
他们真的很危险！

03:30.544 --> 03:33.281
HMM...
唔...

03:33.314 --> 03:35.283
I SENSE NO DANGER HERE.
我感觉这里没有危险。

03:35.316 --> 03:37.618
HOW COULD THEY BE DANGEROUS?
它们怎么可能是危险的？

03:37.651 --> 03:40.321
THEY'RE COVERED
WITH FREE CHEESE!
他们被覆盖了
还有免费奶酪！

03:40.354 --> 03:42.923
ALL I KNOW IS, MR. KRABS SAID...
PATRICK!
我只知道，先生。蟹蟹说……
帕特里克！

03:42.956 --> 03:44.358
DON'T DO THAT!
不要那样做！

03:44.392 --> 03:46.994
MMM...
嗯……

03:47.027 --> 03:48.796
CHEESY.
俗气的。

03:48.829 --> 03:50.398
NO DANGER HERE.
这里没有危险。

03:50.431 --> 03:51.965
GO ON, TRY IT.
继续，尝试一下。

03:51.999 --> 03:53.567
BUT MR. KRABS SAID...
但是先生。蟹蟹说……

03:53.601 --> 03:56.470
SPONGEBOB, LET ME
ASK YOU SOMETHING.
海绵宝宝，让我来
问你一些事情。

03:56.504 --> 03:59.540
DOES THIS LOOK DANGEROUS?
这看起来很危险吗？

03:59.573 --> 04:00.541
( screams )
（尖叫声）

04:00.574 --> 04:01.675
PATRICK! DON'T!
帕特里克！不！

04:01.709 --> 04:03.711
LIGHTEN UP, WILL YOU?
放松点，好吗？

04:03.744 --> 04:07.848
OR DO I HAVE TO EAT
ALL THIS CHEESE BY MYSEL...
还是我必须吃东西
所有这些奶酪都是我自己做的......

04:07.881 --> 04:09.483
WHOA, HO, HO...!
哇，嗬，嗬……！

04:09.517 --> 04:11.319
( gasps )
PATRICK!
（喘气）
帕特里克！

04:11.352 --> 04:13.654
HELP! OH, PATRICK! HELP!
帮助！哦，帕特里克！帮助！

04:13.687 --> 04:15.723
OH, PATRICK, COME BACK!
哦，帕特里克，回来吧！

04:15.756 --> 04:17.057
OH, MY BEST FRIEND!
哦，我最好的朋友！

04:17.090 --> 04:18.058
( laughing )
（笑）

04:18.091 --> 04:19.059
( crying )
（哭）

04:19.092 --> 04:20.060
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

04:20.093 --> 04:22.430
PATRICK... YOU'RE ALIVE!
帕特里克……你还活着！

04:22.463 --> 04:23.597
AM I EVER!
我曾经吗？

04:23.631 --> 04:25.399
YOU SHOULD TRY IT.
你应该尝试一下。

04:25.433 --> 04:26.900
BUT WHAT ABOUT THE SURFACE...
但是表面呢......

04:26.934 --> 04:28.302
AND YOUR BRITCHES...
还有你的内裤...

04:28.336 --> 04:29.269
AND THE GIFT SHOPS?
还有礼品店？

04:29.303 --> 04:32.540
YOU JUST JUMP OFF
BEFORE YOU GO UP
TOO HIGH.
你只需跳下
上楼之前
太高了。

04:32.573 --> 04:35.776
MR. KRABS SAID I SHOULDN'T
GET NEAR THOSE THINGS.
先生。蟹蟹说我不应该
靠近那些东西。

04:35.809 --> 04:38.846
DID HE SAY YOU
SHOULDN'T CLIMB
ON TOP OF THEM
他有说你吗
不应该攀爬
在他们之上

04:38.879 --> 04:40.781
AND RIDE THEM
LIKE A HORSY?
并骑上它们
像一匹马？

04:40.814 --> 04:41.949
WELL, NO.
嗯，不。

04:41.982 --> 04:43.484
WHEE...
呼……

04:43.517 --> 04:45.919
I GUESS HE DIDN'T!
我猜他没有！

04:45.953 --> 04:48.088
( both laughing )
（两人都笑了）

04:48.121 --> 04:51.492
HI-HO, SILVERFISH!
AWAY!
嘿嘿，银鱼！
离开！

04:54.362 --> 04:55.396
( laughing )
（笑）

04:57.598 --> 04:59.533
( laughing )
（笑）

05:01.535 --> 05:02.503
READY?
准备好？

05:02.536 --> 05:03.571
READY.
准备好。

05:03.604 --> 05:05.339
Both:
GERONIMO!
两者：
杰罗尼莫！

05:05.373 --> 05:07.508
( laughing and whooping )
（又笑又叫）

05:07.541 --> 05:11.979
THIS IS MORE FUN
THAN DOUBLE OVERTIME
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB!
这更有趣
超过双倍加时赛
在蟹堡王！

05:15.416 --> 05:16.650
Customer:
P.U.!
客户：
噗！

05:16.684 --> 05:18.051
YOU CALL THIS FOOD?
你管这叫食物？

05:18.085 --> 05:20.721
MY SANDWICH TASTES
LIKE A FRIED BOOT.
我的三明治口味
就像炸靴子一样。

05:20.754 --> 05:22.790
MY SANDWICH IS
A FRIED BOOT!
我的三明治是
炸靴子！

05:22.823 --> 05:24.492
HURRY IT UP,
WILL YOU!
快点，
你愿意吗？

05:24.525 --> 05:27.127
WE'RE HUNGRY
OVER HERE,
LOOK AT US!
我们饿了
在这里，
看看我们！

05:27.160 --> 05:29.763
( customers muttering
angrily... )
（顾客嘀咕
愤怒地……）

05:29.797 --> 05:33.701
THAT'S NOT HOW YOU'RE
SUPPOSED TO FLIP IT!
你不是这样的
应该翻转它！

05:33.734 --> 05:35.636
( all talking at once )
（大家同时说话）

05:35.669 --> 05:38.506
WHY DO YOU WANT TO
EAT THIS STUFF ANYWAY?
你为什么想要
无论如何都要吃这个东西吗？

05:38.539 --> 05:39.973
Krabs:
MR. SQUIDWARD!
螃蟹：
先生。章鱼哥！

05:40.007 --> 05:41.975
WHAT THE HALIBUT'S
GOING ON IN HERE?
什么是大比目鱼
这里发生了什么？

05:42.009 --> 05:43.577
IT'S A FEEDING
FRENZY, SIR
这是一种喂养
疯狂，先生

05:43.611 --> 05:46.146
AND SPONGEBOB'S NOT
BACK FROM HIS BREAK.
而海绵宝宝则不然
休息回来了。

05:46.179 --> 05:49.717
( laughing )
（笑）

05:49.750 --> 05:50.884
WHAT?
什么？

05:50.918 --> 05:52.386
I THOUGHT YOU SAID
我以为你说

05:52.420 --> 05:54.422
SPONGEBOB WAS
TAKING A BREAK.
海绵宝宝是
休息一下。

05:54.455 --> 05:56.990
NO ONE'S TAKEN A BREAK
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB
没有人休息
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅

05:57.024 --> 05:59.927
SINCE THE CHUM FAMINE
OF '59. ( laughs )
自密友饥荒以来
59年的。 （笑）

05:59.960 --> 06:01.762
NOW, WHAT WERE YOU SAYING?
现在，你在说什么？

06:01.795 --> 06:04.131
HE TOOK... A BREAK.
他……休息了一下。

06:07.568 --> 06:11.972
ALL RIGHT, SPONGEBOB LAZYPANTS,
I'LL FIND YOU.
好吧，海绵宝宝懒惰裤，
我会找到你的。

06:12.005 --> 06:16.577
THIS NOSE CAN SMELL LAZINESS
FOR UP TO 10,000 LEAGUES. AHA!
这个鼻子能闻出懒惰的味道
多达 10,000 个联赛。啊哈！

06:16.610 --> 06:19.647
I'LL GIVE YOU A BREAK
YOU'LL NOT SOON FORGET.
我会让你休息一下
您不会很快忘记。

06:21.515 --> 06:25.152
BUT MR. KRABS,
I STILL NEED HELP...!
但是先生。螃蟹，
我仍然需要帮助......！

06:26.887 --> 06:28.756
( sniffing )
（嗅）

06:28.789 --> 06:32.159
THEY SHOULD BE RIGHT HERE.
他们应该就在这里。

06:32.192 --> 06:34.695
( both laughing )
（两人都笑了）

06:34.728 --> 06:35.863
AGAIN?
再次？

06:35.896 --> 06:37.665
AGAIN!
再次！

06:37.698 --> 06:40.000
THE HOOKS! NO, NO, NO!
钩子！不，不，不！

06:40.033 --> 06:42.670
Both:
ONE, TWO, THREE...
两者：
一、二、三……

06:42.703 --> 06:44.572
WAIT, WAIT!
等等，等等！

06:44.605 --> 06:45.573
OOF!
钱币！

06:47.808 --> 06:49.810
BOYS!
男孩们！

06:49.843 --> 06:51.579
I WASN'T QUICK ENOUGH.
我的速度不够快。

06:51.612 --> 06:53.747
THEY'RE GONE! ( sobs )
他们走了！ （抽泣）

06:53.781 --> 06:57.785
IF I COULD ONLY HOLD HIM
IN ME ARMS AGAIN, I, I'D...
如果我能抱着他就好了
再次投入我的怀抱，我，我……

06:57.818 --> 06:59.987
( laughing )
（笑）

07:00.020 --> 07:01.221
I'D THROTTLE THEM!
我会扼杀他们！

07:01.254 --> 07:04.057
WHAT DID I TELL YOU
ABOUT THOSE HOOKS, BOY?
我告诉你什么了
关于那些钩子，男孩？

07:04.091 --> 07:05.092
I, UH, I...
我，呃，我...

07:05.125 --> 07:07.661
I'LL TELL YOU
ABOUT THE HOOKS.
我会告诉你
关于挂钩。

07:07.695 --> 07:10.731
YOU RIDE THEM UP
AND UP AND UP...
你骑上它们
向上又向上...

07:10.764 --> 07:12.633
THEN YOU GENTLY FLOAT
然后你轻轻地漂浮

07:12.666 --> 07:13.667
DOWN.
向下。

07:13.701 --> 07:15.736
AND DO YOU KNOW
WHAT HAPPENS
你知道吗
发生了什么

07:15.769 --> 07:17.638
WHEN YOU DON'T
FLOAT BACK DOWN?
当你不这样做时
浮回下游？

07:17.671 --> 07:18.806
GIFT SHOP?
礼品店？

07:18.839 --> 07:22.643
WORSE! YOU END UP
VACUUM-PACKED...
更糟糕！你最终会
真空包装...

07:22.676 --> 07:23.777
IN A CAN OF TUNA!
金枪鱼罐头！

07:23.811 --> 07:26.046
WITH NOTHING
TO LOOK FORWARD TO
没有任何东西
期待

07:26.079 --> 07:28.215
BUT THE SMELL OF MAYONNAISE!
但是蛋黄酱的味道！

07:28.248 --> 07:29.550
( scream )
（尖叫）

07:29.583 --> 07:30.718
AAH!
啊啊！

07:30.751 --> 07:32.152
Both:
WE'RE SORRY, MR. KRABS.
两者：
我们很抱歉，先生。螃蟹。

07:32.185 --> 07:34.755
I WANT YOU BOYS
TO PROMISE ME
我想要你们男孩
答应我

07:34.788 --> 07:37.891
YOU'LL NEVER GO
ON THOSE HOOKS AGAIN.
你永远不会走
再次陷入困境。

07:37.925 --> 07:39.893
Both:
WE PROMISE, MR. KRABS.
两者：
我们保证，先生。螃蟹。

07:39.927 --> 07:41.595
I NEED A SAILOR'S PROMISE!
我需要水手的承诺！

07:41.629 --> 07:42.863
REPEAT AFTER ME.
跟我重复一遍。

07:42.896 --> 07:46.734
YO-HO, YO-HO,
NEAR THE HOOKS I'LL NEVER GO.
哟呵，哟呵，
靠近钩子我永远不会去。

07:46.767 --> 07:48.502
Both:
YO-HO, YO-HO
两者：
哟呵，哟呵

07:48.536 --> 07:50.170
NEAR THE HOOKS
WE'LL NEVER GO.
靠近钩子
我们永远不会去。

07:50.203 --> 07:52.740
AAH! MOTHER OF PEARL!
啊啊！珍珠母！

07:52.773 --> 07:55.042
FIRE ON THE POOP DECK!
船尾甲板着火了！

07:55.075 --> 07:57.044
Both:
AAH! MOTHER OF PEARL!
两者：
啊啊！珍珠母！

07:57.077 --> 07:58.779
FIRE ON THE POOP DECK!
船尾甲板着火了！

07:58.812 --> 07:59.947
WELL... WHEW!
嗯...哇！

07:59.980 --> 08:01.114
ALL RIGHT, THEN.
好吧，那么。

08:01.148 --> 08:03.751
LET'S GET OUT OF
THIS DEATHTRAP.
让我们离开吧
这个死亡陷阱。

08:03.784 --> 08:06.086
SpongeBob:
OKAY, GARY, TODAY IS A NEW DAY.
海绵宝宝：
好吧，加里，今天是新的一天。

08:06.119 --> 08:08.989
I'M READY TO PROVE MYSELF
LOYAL TO MR. KRABS.
我已准备好证明自己
忠于先生。螃蟹。

08:09.022 --> 08:10.123
( Gary meows )
（加里喵）

08:10.157 --> 08:12.159
I'M READY!
我准备好了！

08:12.192 --> 08:14.862
* I'M READY, I'M READY,
I'M READY, I'M READY *
* 我准备好了，我准备好了，
我准备好了，我准备好了*

08:14.895 --> 08:17.297
* I'M READY, READY, READY,
I'M READY... *
*我准备好了，准备好了，准备好了，
我准备好了... *

08:17.330 --> 08:18.298
HEY, SPONGEBOB!
嘿，海绵宝宝！

08:18.331 --> 08:20.300
YOU'RE GOING THE WRONG WAY!
你走错路了！

08:20.333 --> 08:21.301
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

08:21.334 --> 08:23.136
I ALWAYS GO TO WORK THIS WAY.
我总是这样去上班。

08:23.170 --> 08:25.806
YOU'RE NOT GOING
TO WORK TODAY.
你不会去
今天上班。

08:25.839 --> 08:27.608
WE'RE GOING TO
GO PLAY...
我们要去
去玩吧...

08:27.641 --> 08:29.309
HOOKY!
好极了！

08:29.342 --> 08:31.144
BUT PATRICK,
WE PROMISED.
但是帕特里克，
我们承诺过。

08:31.178 --> 08:33.213
I HAD MY FINGERS CROSSED.
我已经祈祷了。

08:33.246 --> 08:34.882
YOU DON'T HAVE FINGERS.
你没有手指。

08:34.915 --> 08:38.586
WELL, THAT MR. KRABS
IS JUST A BIG DUMMY.
嗯，那个先生。蟹蟹
只是一个大假人。

08:38.619 --> 08:41.655
WE PLAYED
ON THOSE HOOKS
ALL DAY LONG
我们玩过
陷入困境
一整天

08:41.689 --> 08:43.957
AND NOTHING
HAPPENED TO US.
什么也没有
发生在我们身上。

08:43.991 --> 08:45.125
BUT MR. KRABS SAID...
但是先生。蟹蟹说……

08:45.158 --> 08:46.660
LOOK, SPONGEBOB.
看，海绵宝宝。

08:46.694 --> 08:49.830
ARE YOU GOING TO
LISTEN TO A BIG DUMMY
你要去吗
听一个大假人的话

08:49.863 --> 08:52.299
OR ARE YOU GOING TO
LISTEN TO ME?
或者你打算
听我说？

08:52.332 --> 08:54.802
UM...
嗯...

08:54.835 --> 08:56.670
SEE YOU LATER,
SPONGEBOB.
稍后见，
海绵宝宝。

08:56.704 --> 08:58.271
I'M GOING TO GO HAVE SOME FUN.
我要去玩玩。

08:59.873 --> 09:00.941
WHOO-HOO!
呼呼！

09:02.943 --> 09:04.645
COME ON, SPONGEBOB!
来吧，海绵宝宝！

09:04.678 --> 09:05.913
WHOO-HOO!
呼呼！

09:05.946 --> 09:09.783
YOU KNOW
YOU WANT TO...
你知道
你想要...

09:09.817 --> 09:11.852
OH... I KNOW I WANT TO
哦...我知道我想要

09:11.885 --> 09:16.189
BUT I PROMISED MR. KRABS
I WOULDN'T GO NEAR ANOTHER...
AAH, HOOK!
但我答应了先生。蟹蟹
我不会靠近另一个......
啊啊，钩子！

09:20.694 --> 09:23.931
OH, NO. MR. KRABS
TOLD ME ALL ABOUT YOU.
哦，不。先生。蟹蟹
告诉我关于你的一切。

09:23.964 --> 09:26.233
YOU ARE A LIAR,
A DECEIVER!
你是个骗子，
一个骗子！

09:26.266 --> 09:29.369
I'LL NEVER FALL
FOR YOUR TRICKS AGAIN!
我永远不会跌倒
再次展现你的技巧！

09:29.402 --> 09:31.872
NEVER!
绝不！

09:32.906 --> 09:34.107
IS THIS SEAT TAKEN?
这个座位有人吗？

09:34.141 --> 09:37.010
WHOO...
( laughing )
呼...
（笑）

09:37.044 --> 09:39.179
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

09:39.212 --> 09:41.849
HOO, GLAD I GOT THAT
OUT OF MY SYSTEM.
呼，很高兴我明白了
超出我的系统。

09:41.882 --> 09:43.383
( gasps )
（喘气）

09:43.416 --> 09:45.185
I'M... HOOKED.
我……着迷了。

09:45.218 --> 09:46.186
AND THAT MEANS...
这意味着......

09:49.089 --> 09:50.023
( screams )
（尖叫声）

09:50.057 --> 09:52.325
HELP! I'M HOOKED! HELP!
帮助！我着迷了！帮助！

09:52.359 --> 09:53.794
MR. KRABS, HELP!
先生。蟹蟹，救命啊！

09:53.827 --> 09:55.729
IT HAPPENED! I'M HOOKED!
它发生了！我着迷了！

09:55.763 --> 09:57.898
OH, NO, THE HOOK, THE HOOK!
哦，不，是钩子，是钩子！

09:57.931 --> 09:59.867
GIFT SHOP! TUNA CAN!
礼品店！金枪鱼可以！

09:59.900 --> 10:02.135
MAYONNAISE!
蛋黄酱！

10:02.169 --> 10:03.971
Krabs:
HERE YOU GO, PEARL.
螃蟹：
给你，珍珠。

10:04.004 --> 10:06.874
FREE WATER FOR ALL
YOUR LITTLE FRIENDS.
为所有人提供免费水
你的小朋友们。

10:06.907 --> 10:08.976
THANKS, DAD.
谢谢，爸爸。

10:09.009 --> 10:12.312
JUST DON'T FORGET TO LEAVE A TIP
FOR OLD MR. KRABS.
只是不要忘记留下小费
献给老先生。螃蟹。

10:12.345 --> 10:14.414
PSST! MR. KRABS...
嘘！先生。螃蟹...

10:14.447 --> 10:17.017
SPONGEBOB!
YOU'RE TWO MINUTES LATE!
海绵宝宝！
YOU'RE TWO MINUTES LATE!

10:17.050 --> 10:18.418
WHAT KEPT YOU, LADDIE?
是什么让你坚持下去，小伙子？

10:18.451 --> 10:21.822
UM, YOU KNOW THOSE HOOKS
WE WERE TALKING ABOUT YESTERDAY?
嗯，你知道那些钩子
我们在谈论昨天的事吗？

10:21.855 --> 10:24.758
DIDN'T I TELL YOU
NOT TO GO NEAR THOSE HOOKS?
我没告诉过你吗
不要靠近那些钩子？

10:24.792 --> 10:27.027
UM... NO.
嗯...不。

10:27.060 --> 10:29.997
ER...! I MEAN YES, YES,
YOU TOLD ME NOT TO GO NEAR THEM!
呃……！我的意思是，是的，是的，
你告诉我不要靠近他们！

10:30.030 --> 10:34.768
WELL, YOU WEREN'T PLAYING ON
THOSE HOOKS, WERE YOU, LADDIE?
好吧，你没有玩过
那些钩子，是你吗，小伙子？

10:34.802 --> 10:36.303
OF COURSE NOT...
当然不是...

10:36.336 --> 10:38.405
ER, I MEAN, NOT EXACTLY.
呃，我的意思是，不完全是。

10:38.438 --> 10:41.074
ER, I MEAN, YES! YES, I DID IT!
呃，我的意思是，是的！是的，我做到了！

10:41.108 --> 10:43.410
I ADMIT IT!
我承认！

10:43.443 --> 10:45.679
( crying )
（哭）

10:45.713 --> 10:48.949
OH, MR. KRABS,
I'M SO ASHAMED!
哦，先生。螃蟹，
我很羞愧！

10:48.982 --> 10:50.884
I MEAN, LOOK AT ME!
我的意思是，看着我！

10:50.918 --> 10:52.886
I'M HOOKED...!
我着迷了...！

10:52.920 --> 10:55.455
HMM, IT'S IN THERE PRETTY DEEP.
嗯，它在那里很深。

10:55.488 --> 10:56.824
WHAT AM I GOING TO DO?
我要做什么？

10:56.857 --> 10:59.827
THERE'S ONLY ONE THING
TO DO, BOY.
只有一件事
要做的事，男孩。

10:59.860 --> 11:02.162
( all laughing )
（大家都笑了）

11:04.297 --> 11:05.733
OH, NO, MR. KRABS.
哦，不，先生。螃蟹。

11:05.766 --> 11:07.367
I CAN'T TAKE OFF MY PANTS.
我脱不掉裤子。

11:07.400 --> 11:09.970
NOT IN FRONT OF ALL THESE...
GIRLS.
不在所有这些面前......
女孩们。

11:10.003 --> 11:10.971
( reeling )
（卷绕）

11:11.004 --> 11:12.072
( gasps )
（喘气）

11:12.105 --> 11:17.044
OH, OKAY, I'M TAKING THEM OFF,
I'M TAKING THEM OFF.
OH, OKAY, I'M TAKING THEM OFF,
我要把它们脱掉。

11:17.077 --> 11:18.311
( rips ) THERE.
（撕裂）那里。

11:18.345 --> 11:20.013
UH, LAD.
呃，小伙子。

11:20.047 --> 11:22.115
( girls laughing )
（女孩们笑）

11:22.149 --> 11:23.350
( screams )
（尖叫声）

11:23.383 --> 11:24.785
OH, NO, OH, NO.
哦，不，哦，不。

11:24.818 --> 11:27.020
NO, NO, NO, MR. KRABS,
I CAN'T DO IT!
不，不，不，先生。螃蟹，
我做不到！

11:27.054 --> 11:28.255
ANYTHING BUT THAT.
除此之外。

11:28.288 --> 11:30.157
I UNDERSTAND.
我明白。

11:30.190 --> 11:33.160
YOU WERE A GOOD LITTLE
FRY COOK, SPONGEBOB.
你是个好孩子
炒菜做饭，海绵宝宝。

11:33.193 --> 11:34.327
( gasps )
（喘气）

11:34.361 --> 11:36.429
BUT WE'LL FIND ANOTHER.
但我们会找到另一个。

11:36.463 --> 11:41.068
HOPEFULLY, ONE THAT WILL
LISTEN TO OLD MR. KRABS.
希望能够实现这一目标
听老先生的话螃蟹。

11:41.101 --> 11:44.938
OH, MR. KRABS,
I'LL LISTEN, I PROMISE!
哦，先生。螃蟹，
我会听的，我保证！

11:44.972 --> 11:46.239
WHOA, WHOA...!
哇，哇……！

11:46.273 --> 11:48.241
PLEASE SAVE ME, MR. KRABS!
请救救我，先生。螃蟹！

11:48.275 --> 11:49.409
( crying )
（哭）

11:49.442 --> 11:52.479
I PROMISE I'LL BE GOOD!
我保证我会做好事！

11:52.512 --> 11:53.881
HOO!
呼！

11:55.348 --> 11:56.950
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

11:56.984 --> 12:00.087
All:
OH, LOOK... ( giggling )
全部：
哦，看……（咯咯笑）

12:00.120 --> 12:03.957
Pearl:
IT'S SPONGEBOB NUDIEPANTS.
珍珠：
这是海绵宝宝裸裤。

12:03.991 --> 12:05.192
( screams )
（尖叫声）

12:05.225 --> 12:07.360
( all laughing )
（大家都笑了）

12:07.394 --> 12:11.064
WELL, THAT WAS
MORE OF SPONGEBOB
THAN I NEEDED TO SEE.
嗯，那是
更多海绵宝宝
比我需要看到的。

12:11.098 --> 12:13.767
MR. SQUIDWARD,
THAT WAS SOME
FINE ANGLING.
先生。章鱼哥，
那是一些
精细钓鱼。

12:13.801 --> 12:16.837
DO YOU THINK THE LAD
HAS LEARNED HIS LESSON?
你认为小伙子
吸取教训了吗？

12:16.870 --> 12:20.340
Squidward:
OH, I THINK HE'LL REMEMBER THIS
FOR A LONG TIME.
章鱼哥：
哦，我想他会记住这一点
很长一段时间。

12:20.373 --> 12:21.508
I KNOW I WILL.
我知道我会的。

12:21.541 --> 12:23.176
THE PANTS!
THE UNDERWEAR!
裤子！
内衣！

12:23.210 --> 12:25.879
( both laughing... )
（两人都笑了……）

12:29.883 --> 12:32.986
Patrick:
HELLO? DOES SOMEBODY
HAVE A CAN OPENER?
帕特里克：
你好？有人吗
有开罐器吗？

12:45.465 --> 12:48.902
Narrator:
AH... SATURDAY MORNING
IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
旁白：
啊...星期六早上
比基尼下装。

12:48.936 --> 12:52.539
SPONGEBOB IS WATCHING HIS
FAVORITE SATURDAY MORNING SHOW
海绵宝宝正在看他的
最喜欢的周六早间节目

12:52.572 --> 12:55.575
THE ADVENTURES OF MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY.
美人鱼历险记
还有藤壶男孩。

12:55.608 --> 12:59.813
ENJOYING A BOWL OF MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY BRAN CEREAL.
享受一碗美人鱼
和 Barnacleboy 麸皮谷物。

12:59.847 --> 13:05.185
AND WEARING THE OFFICIAL
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
BREAKFAST BITERS.
并穿着官方服装
美人鱼与藤壶男孩
早餐爱好者。

13:05.218 --> 13:07.020
( show theme playing )
（展示主题曲）

13:07.054 --> 13:09.890
MermaidMan,
fleet and forceful...
美人鱼人,
快速而有力...

13:09.923 --> 13:12.259
BY THE POWER OF NEPTUNE!
借助海王星的力量！

13:12.292 --> 13:14.394
AIDED BY HIS YOUNG WARD...
在他年轻的病房的帮助下......

13:15.395 --> 13:18.832
AIDED BY HIS YOUNG WARD...
在他年轻的病房的帮助下......

13:18.866 --> 13:19.599
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

13:19.632 --> 13:21.101
PROTECTING THE SEA
保护海洋

13:21.134 --> 13:23.503
WITH FEATS OF STRENGTH
AND AGILITY...
凭借力量的壮举
和敏捷性...

13:23.536 --> 13:25.072
( both grunting )
（两人都咕哝着）

13:25.105 --> 13:26.106
( crack )
（ 裂缝 ）

13:27.274 --> 13:30.443
TO THE CHIROPRACTOR!
致脊椎按摩师！

13:30.477 --> 13:33.113
AWAY...!
离开...！

13:33.146 --> 13:35.348
FIGHTING A ROGUES GALLERY
OF VILLAINS
战斗盗贼画廊
恶棍

13:35.382 --> 13:38.118
LIKE THE SINISTER SLUG...
就像邪恶的蛞蝓一样……

13:38.151 --> 13:40.387
THE ATOMIC FLOUNDER...
原子比目鱼...

13:40.420 --> 13:43.423
AND THE DREADED JUMBO SHRIMP!
还有可怕的大虾！

13:43.456 --> 13:46.894
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
UNITE!
美人鱼与藤壶男孩
团结起来！

13:50.063 --> 13:54.434
HEY, KIDS, ARE YOU READY
TO HEAR THE WINNER OF
THIS WEEK'S CONTEST?
嘿，孩子们，你们准备好了吗？
聆听获胜者的声音
本周的比赛？

13:54.467 --> 13:56.269
I'M READY! I'M READY!
我准备好了！我准备好了！

13:56.303 --> 13:59.639
OUR WINNER WILL RECEIVE A
SPECIAL SECRET COLLECTOR'S ITEM
我们的获胜者将获得
特别秘密收藏家的物品

13:59.672 --> 14:03.076
FROM THE ADVENTURES OF
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY!
来自冒险
美人鱼和藤壶男孩！

14:03.110 --> 14:04.544
AND THE WINNER IS...
获胜者是...

14:04.577 --> 14:05.378
( chattering )
（喋喋不休）

14:05.412 --> 14:08.348
SPRINGBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...
SpringBOOB SQUIREPIN...

14:08.381 --> 14:10.984
AW... I WORKED FOREVER
ON THOSE LIFE-SIZE
噢...我一直在工作
真人大小

14:11.018 --> 14:14.321
CRABBY PATTY MANNEQUINS OF
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY.
暴躁的肉饼人体模型
美人鱼和藤壶男孩。

14:14.354 --> 14:19.226
...FOR THESE LIFE-SIZE
CRABBY PATTY MANNEQUINS
OF MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY!
...对于这些真人大小的
暴躁的肉饼人体模型
美人鱼和藤壶男孩！

14:19.259 --> 14:22.329
HEY! SPRINGBOOB SQUIREPIN
STOLE MY IDEA!
嘿！斯普林布布乡绅
偷了我的主意！

14:22.362 --> 14:23.496
( talking rapidly )
（语速很快）

14:23.530 --> 14:25.265
WHAT'S THAT?
那是什么？

14:25.298 --> 14:29.302
OH... IT APPEARS I'VE MADE
A SLIGHT ERROR IN PRONUNCIATION.
哦...看来是我做的
发音上有一个小错误。

14:29.336 --> 14:31.939
THE REAL NAME
OF THE WINNER IS...
真实姓名
获胜者是...

14:31.972 --> 14:33.974
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

14:34.007 --> 14:36.543
SpongeBob:
WA-HOO!
海绵宝宝：
哇呼！

14:36.576 --> 14:40.047
OH, I WONDER WHEN MY PRIZE
WILL... GET HERE...
哦，我想知道我的奖品什么时候
将...到达这里...

14:40.080 --> 14:42.215
MY PRIZE!
我的奖品！

14:42.249 --> 14:46.153
( crying, blowing nose )
（哭、擤鼻涕）

14:46.186 --> 14:48.288
( laughing )
（笑）

14:48.321 --> 14:49.289
( gasps )
（喘气）

14:49.322 --> 14:51.058
CAN IT BE?
可以吗？

14:51.091 --> 14:52.225
IT IS!
这是！

14:52.259 --> 14:54.061
THE CONCH SIGNAL!
海螺信号！

14:54.094 --> 14:58.165
FROM THE ADVENTURES OF
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY.
来自冒险
美人鱼和藤壶男孩。

14:58.198 --> 14:59.933
AS SEEN ON TV!
正如电视上所见！

14:59.967 --> 15:02.302
I WONDER IF IT STILL WORKS?
我想知道它是否仍然有效？

15:02.335 --> 15:03.603
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

15:03.636 --> 15:07.474
( blows weak sour note )
（吹出微弱的酸味）

15:07.507 --> 15:11.244
( note echoing... )
（注意呼应...）

15:11.278 --> 15:13.113
THE CONCH SIGNAL!
海螺信号！

15:13.146 --> 15:16.649
TO THE INVISIBLE
BOATMOBILE!
走向无形
移动船！

15:18.718 --> 15:20.687
( grunting and groaning... )
（咕哝和呻吟……）

15:28.661 --> 15:30.597
UH, MERMAIDMAN?
呃，美人鱼？

15:30.630 --> 15:32.065
YES, BARNACLEBOY?
是的，藤壶男孩？

15:32.099 --> 15:34.667
WE'RE NOT IN THE INVISIBLE
BOATMOBILE, ARE WE?
我们不在无形之中
我们是移动船吗？

15:34.701 --> 15:35.668
UH, NOPE.
呃，不。

15:35.702 --> 15:37.070
( both grunt )
（两人都咕哝）

15:37.104 --> 15:39.172
I TOLD YOU MAKING
THE BOATMOBILE INVISIBLE
我告诉过你做
隐形移动船

15:39.206 --> 15:40.340
WAS A STUPID IDEA.
这是一个愚蠢的主意。

15:40.373 --> 15:42.642
COME OUT, COME OUT,
WHEREVER YOU ARE.
出来，出来，
无论您身在何处。

15:42.675 --> 15:45.012
IT'S GOT TO BE HERE SOMEWHERE...
OHH!
它一定在这儿的某个地方……
哦！

15:45.045 --> 15:47.114
OH, MERMAIDMAN, I THINK I...
哦，美人鱼，我想我……

15:47.147 --> 15:48.615
MermaidMan:
FOUND IT!
人鱼男：
找到了！

15:50.183 --> 15:51.518
COME ON,
GET A MOVE ON, SON.
来吧，
继续前进，儿子。

15:51.551 --> 15:53.453
WE DON'T HAVE ALL DAY.
我们没有一整天的时间。

15:53.486 --> 15:54.454
IGNITION...
点火...

15:54.487 --> 15:55.355
ON!
在！

15:55.388 --> 15:57.257
ROCKET ON!
火箭发射！

15:57.290 --> 16:00.327
( engine roaring... )
（发动机轰鸣……）

16:03.063 --> 16:04.597
HMM...
唔...

16:04.631 --> 16:07.234
MAYBE THE CONCH SIGNAL
DOESN'T WORK ANYMORE.
也许是海螺信号
不再起作用了。

16:07.267 --> 16:08.701
( meows )
（喵）

16:08.735 --> 16:11.571
( engine roaring,
tires squealing,
cat screeching )
（发动机轰鸣，
轮胎吱吱作响，
猫尖叫）

16:11.604 --> 16:13.140
MermaidMan:
TORPEDO MODE!
人鱼男：
鱼雷模式！

16:13.173 --> 16:15.242
FIRE!
火！

16:15.275 --> 16:17.110
MERMAIDMAN!
美人鱼！

16:17.144 --> 16:19.479
( dazed ):
AND BOBICLE BOB...
（茫然）：
还有鲍勃鲍勃……

16:19.512 --> 16:21.248
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT,
GARY.
我不敢相信，
加里。

16:21.281 --> 16:23.483
MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY
IN OUR HOME!
美人鱼
和藤壶男孩
在我们家！

16:23.516 --> 16:24.484
( meows )
（喵）

16:24.517 --> 16:26.319
EXCUSE ME, I'M...
对不起，我...

16:26.353 --> 16:27.587
OH, MY NEPTUNE!
哦，我的海王星！

16:27.620 --> 16:29.722
HE'S BEEN
HORRIBLY DISFIGURED!
他曾经
严重毁容！

16:29.756 --> 16:33.760
OH, BLAST US!
WE'RE TOO LATE!
哦，爆炸我们！
我们太晚了！

16:33.793 --> 16:34.761
OH, PLEASE.
哦，拜托。

16:34.794 --> 16:36.463
HE'S NOT DISFIGURED
他没有毁容

16:36.496 --> 16:40.067
HE'S, HE'S, JUST
THAT SPONGE KID AGAIN.
他是，他是，只是
又是那个海绵宝宝。

16:40.100 --> 16:41.368
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

16:41.401 --> 16:43.070
GOOD TO SEE YOU, LAD!
很高兴见到你，小伙子！

16:43.103 --> 16:45.638
SAY, BARNACLEBOY,
WE'VE GOT TO FIND OUT
说吧，藤壶男孩，
我们必须找出答案

16:45.672 --> 16:48.241
WHERE THAT CONCH SIGNAL
CAME FROM.
海螺信号在哪里
来自。

16:48.275 --> 16:50.410
OH, I BLEW
THE CONCH SIGNAL, SIR.
哦，我爆炸了
海螺信号，长官。

16:50.443 --> 16:53.246
ALL RIGHT,
WHERE'S THE DANGER, SON?
好吧，
儿子，危险在哪里？

16:53.280 --> 16:54.414
BRING IT ON.
来吧。

16:54.447 --> 16:55.582
BRING IT ON!
来吧！

16:55.615 --> 16:57.284
THERE'S NO DANGER.
没有危险。

16:57.317 --> 16:58.351
Both:
NO DANGER?!
两者：
没有危险？！

16:58.385 --> 17:00.220
LOOK, THERE
HAS TO BE DANGER.
看，那里
一定有危险。

17:00.253 --> 17:03.223
YOU BLEW
THE CONCH SIGNAL,
AND WHEN YOU BLOW...
你搞砸了
海螺信号，
当你吹的时候...

17:03.256 --> 17:05.458
WHERE DID YOU GET
THAT THING ANYWAY?
你从哪里得到的
无论如何，那件事？

17:05.492 --> 17:06.693
I WON IT IN A CONTEST.
我在比赛中赢得了它。

17:06.726 --> 17:07.794
Both:
CONTEST?
两者：
比赛？

17:07.827 --> 17:10.297
THEY DON'T TELL US
ANYTHING ANYMORE!
他们不告诉我们
还可以吗！

17:10.330 --> 17:12.432
LOOK, SPONGY, THAT AIN'T NO TOY.
看，海绵，那不是玩具。

17:12.465 --> 17:15.068
THAT'S RIGHT--
THE CONCH SIGNAL
没错——
海螺信号

17:15.102 --> 17:17.170
IS AN AWESOME
RESPONSIBILITY.
太棒了
责任。

17:17.204 --> 17:20.607
WE'RE DUTY-BOUND
TO HELP WHENEVER
IT SOUNDS.
我们责无旁贷
随时提供帮助
听起来。

17:20.640 --> 17:22.775
BUT YOU ONLY BLOW IT
WHEN THERE'S TROUBLE
但你只是搞砸了
当出现问题时

17:22.809 --> 17:25.078
OR THERE WILL BE TROUBLE,
YOU GOT THAT?
否则会有麻烦，
你明白了吗？

17:25.112 --> 17:26.213
YES, SIRS!
是的，先生们！

17:26.246 --> 17:28.248
GOOD BOY!
好孩子！

17:28.281 --> 17:29.216
( click tongues )
（点击舌头）

17:29.249 --> 17:30.650
COME ON, COME ON,
COME ON.
来吧，来吧，
来吧。

17:30.683 --> 17:32.452
THEY'RE SERVING
MEAT LOAF TODAY.
他们正在服务
今天的肉饼。

17:32.485 --> 17:33.786
OH, GOODY!
哦，好极了！

17:33.820 --> 17:35.488
DON'T WORRY, MERMAIDMAN.
别担心，美人鱼。

17:35.522 --> 17:38.791
YOU WON'T BE HEARING FROM ME
FOR JUST ANYTHING.
你不会收到我的消息
为了任何事情。

17:38.825 --> 17:41.094
ONLY FOR THE BIG EMERGENCIES!
仅适用于重大紧急情况！

17:41.128 --> 17:43.096
WILL YOU HURRY UP IN THERE?
你能快点进去吗？

17:43.130 --> 17:44.831
AND SAVE ME SOME HOT WA...
并给我留点热饮...

17:44.864 --> 17:47.734
( conch signal blowing )
（海螺信号吹响）

17:47.767 --> 17:50.370
THE CONCH SIGNAL!
海螺信号！

17:50.403 --> 17:51.504
COME, YOUNG WARD!
来吧，年轻的病房！

17:51.538 --> 17:52.705
( groans )
（呻吟）

17:54.807 --> 17:57.277
( grunting and groaning )
（咕哝和呻吟）

17:57.310 --> 17:59.512
( tires squeal,
cat screeches )
（轮胎发出尖叫声，
猫的尖叫声）

18:02.349 --> 18:06.186
OH... YOUTH!
哦...青春！

18:06.219 --> 18:08.388
CUT DOWN IN ITS PRIME!
削减它的黄金时期！

18:08.421 --> 18:10.490
( groaning )
（呻吟）

18:10.523 --> 18:12.359
OH, SPEAK TO ME, SON.
哦，跟我说话，儿子。

18:12.392 --> 18:16.896
HELP... CAN'T...
OPEN MAYONNAISE.
救命……不能……
打开蛋黄酱。

18:16.929 --> 18:21.168
WHAT?! I COME DOWN HERE
IN MY UNDERWEAR TO OPEN
A JAR OF MAYONNAISE?!
什么？！我来这里
在我的内衣里打开
一罐蛋黄酱？！

18:21.201 --> 18:22.535
BUT...
但...

18:22.569 --> 18:25.238
BUT NOTHING! WE CAN'T
GO AROUND SOCIALIZING.
但什么也没有！我们不能
四处社交。

18:25.272 --> 18:28.308
WE HAVE TO BE PREPARED
FOR, UH... EMERGENCIES!
我们必须做好准备
为了，呃……紧急情况！

18:28.341 --> 18:30.177
BARNACLEBOY,
THINK ABOUT IT.
藤壶男孩，
想一想。

18:30.210 --> 18:33.546
EMERGENCIES DON'T COME AROUND
AS OFTEN AS THEY USED TO.
紧急情况不会发生
和以前一样频繁。

18:33.580 --> 18:34.914
ALL RIGHT, OKAY.
好吧，好吧。

18:34.947 --> 18:37.450
YOU CAN BLOW THE CONCH
EVERY ONCE IN A WHILE
你可以吹海螺
每隔一段时间

18:37.484 --> 18:41.154
JUST GIVE US SOMETHING TO DO
WHEN WE SHOW UP!
只要给我们一些事可做
当我们出现时！

18:41.188 --> 18:42.322
YAY!
YAY!
耶！
耶！

18:44.257 --> 18:45.892
( conch signal blowing )
（海螺信号吹响）

18:45.925 --> 18:46.893
DANGER!
危险！

18:55.668 --> 18:57.136
( no dialogue )
（无对话）

18:58.605 --> 19:01.274
ALL RIGHT, THAT'S IT!
GIVE ME THAT!
好吧，就是这样！
给我那个！

19:01.308 --> 19:02.609
YOU'RE RUNNING US
RAGGED.
你在操纵我们
衣衫褴褛。

19:02.642 --> 19:06.746
MUST... MUST ANSWER
THE CLARION CALL!
必须...必须回答
号角号角！

19:06.779 --> 19:07.914
( groans )
（呻吟）

19:07.947 --> 19:09.549
WE'RE EXHAUSTED!
我们筋疲力尽了！

19:09.582 --> 19:12.285
I'M SORRY, BARNACLEBOY.
对不起，藤壶男孩。

19:12.319 --> 19:13.586
I DIDN'T MEAN IT, I...
我不是故意的，我...

19:13.620 --> 19:16.589
JUST WANTED TO SPEND TIME
WITH YOU.
只是想消磨时间
和你在一起。

19:16.623 --> 19:19.326
( crying ):
YOU'RE MY HEROES!
（哭）：
你们是我的英雄！

19:19.359 --> 19:22.195
IT'S TOO LATE FOR THAT,
MR. CONTEST WINNER.
为时已晚，
先生。比赛获胜者。

19:22.229 --> 19:25.898
I'M GOING TO DESTROY THIS THING
WITH MY... SULFUR VISION!
我要毁掉这个东西
带着我的……硫磺愿景！

19:25.932 --> 19:28.701
( grunting )
（咕哝）

19:28.735 --> 19:30.537
( groans )
（呻吟）

19:30.570 --> 19:32.772
( grunting )
（咕哝）

19:32.805 --> 19:33.940
( groans )
（呻吟）

19:33.973 --> 19:35.442
WELL, I'LL DESTROY IT
好吧，我会毁掉它

19:35.475 --> 19:37.544
WHEN I GET BACK TO
THE, UH, MERMALAIR.
当我回到
呃，美马艾尔。

19:37.577 --> 19:39.712
AND AS FOR YOU...
至于你...

19:39.746 --> 19:43.216
BARNACLEBOY...
DON'T SQUASH HIS ENTHUSIASM.
藤壶男孩...
不要压制他的热情。

19:43.250 --> 19:46.619
AFTER ALL, HE COULD BE
THE HERO OF TOMORROW.
毕竟，他可能是
明日英雄。

19:46.653 --> 19:47.720
OR THE VILLAIN.
或恶棍。

19:47.754 --> 19:48.988
BESIDES...
除了...

19:49.021 --> 19:51.658
I REMEMBER ANOTHER
YOUNG WHIPPERSNAPPER
我记得还有一个
年轻的笛鲷

19:51.691 --> 19:54.561
WHO WANTED TO BE A SUPER-HERO.
( chuckles )
谁想成为超级英雄。
（笑声）

19:54.594 --> 19:57.730
YOU DON'T EVEN REMEMBER
BREAKFAST, YOU OLD COOT.
你甚至不记得
早餐吧，你这个老笨蛋。

19:57.764 --> 19:59.599
( crying )
（哭）

19:59.632 --> 20:02.635
MAYBE THE CONCH SIGNAL
IS TOO MUCH RESPONSIBILITY.
也许是海螺信号
责任太大。

20:02.669 --> 20:07.440
BUT HOW WOULD YOU LIKE
TO SPEND THE REST OF THE
AFTERNOON... ON PATROL?
但你想怎么样
花掉剩下的钱
下午...巡逻？

20:07.474 --> 20:08.408
WHAT?!
什么？！

20:08.441 --> 20:11.478
TO THE INVISIBLE
BOATMOBILE!
走向无形
移动船！

20:11.511 --> 20:13.280
SpongeBob:
* OH...
海绵宝宝：
* 哦...

20:13.313 --> 20:14.914
SpongeBob and MermaidMan:
* JINGLE BELLS
海绵宝宝和美人鱼：
* 铃儿响叮当

20:14.947 --> 20:17.950
* MERMAIDMAN SMELLS,
BARNACLEBOY LAID AN EGG *
* 美人鱼的气味，
藤壶男孩下了一个蛋 *

20:17.984 --> 20:20.487
* THE INVISIBLE BOATMOBILE
LOST A WHEEL AND... *
* 隐形移动船
失去了一个轮子并且... *

20:20.520 --> 20:21.654
HEY, CAN I DRIVE?
嘿，我可以开车吗？

20:21.688 --> 20:22.822
DRIVE?
WHAT DO YOU KNOW
驾驶？
你知道什么

20:22.855 --> 20:24.857
ABOUT DRIVING
THE INVISIBLE BOATMOBILE?
关于驾驶
隐形移动船？

20:24.891 --> 20:27.394
TONS! LIKE THE WINDSHIELD WIPERS
ARE RIGHT HERE.
吨！就像挡风玻璃雨刷器一样
就在这里。

20:27.427 --> 20:29.496
DON'T TOUCH THAT BUTTON!
IT'S THE...
不要触碰那个按钮！
这是...

20:29.529 --> 20:31.964
( grunting and groaning )
（咕哝和呻吟）

20:31.998 --> 20:34.767
...ORIGAMI BUTTON.
...折纸按钮。

20:34.801 --> 20:39.038
MermaidMan:
WHEN YOU'RE PATROLLING THE CITY,
YOU ALWAYS HAVE TO BE VIGILANT.
人鱼男：
当你在城市巡逻时，
您必须始终保持警惕。

20:39.071 --> 20:42.542
ON YOUR TOES,
CONSTANTLY ALERT.
踮起脚尖，
时刻保持警惕。

20:42.575 --> 20:45.645
ALWAYS EXPECT
THE UNEXPECTED.
永远期待
意想不到的。

20:45.678 --> 20:46.679
( both gasp )
（两人都喘气）

20:46.713 --> 20:48.948
( screaming... )
（尖叫……）

20:48.981 --> 20:50.950
I'VE GOT THE DONUTS!
我有甜甜圈！

20:50.983 --> 20:54.754
SpongeBob and MermaidMan:
* ...AND BARNACLEBOY
LAID AN EGG, HEY, HEY! *
海绵宝宝和美人鱼：
* ...AND BARNACLEBOY
LAID AN EGG, HEY, HEY! *

20:54.787 --> 20:56.289
OH, THAT FELLOW
OVER THERE
哦，那个家伙
在那儿

20:56.323 --> 20:57.724
USED TO BE
THE ATOMIC FLOUNDER.
曾经是
原子比目鱼。

20:57.757 --> 20:59.559
I KNOW HE DOESN'T
LOOK LIKE MUCH
我知道他不知道
看起来很像

20:59.592 --> 21:01.628
BUT HE COULD
GO BACK TO CRIME...
但他可以
回到犯罪……

21:01.661 --> 21:03.730
( snaps fingers )
...JUST LIKE THAT.
（打响指）
...就像这样。

21:03.763 --> 21:04.597
( both laugh )
（两人都笑了）

21:04.631 --> 21:06.466
Flounder:
HELP! HELP!
比目鱼：
救命！帮助！

21:06.499 --> 21:08.067
HELP, SOMEBODY THERE!
救命，有人！

21:08.100 --> 21:11.438
YOU'RE UNDER ARREST,
ATOMIC FLOUNDER!
你被捕了，
原子比目鱼！

21:11.471 --> 21:12.639
STOP, KID, STOP!
停下来，孩子，停下来！

21:12.672 --> 21:13.906
LET HIM GO!
让他走吧！

21:13.940 --> 21:16.643
YOU SAID HE COULD SNAP...
JUST LIKE THAT.
你说他可以折断...
就像那样。

21:16.676 --> 21:18.077
WHAT?!
GET OFF OF ME!
什么？！
滚开我！

21:18.110 --> 21:21.414
IF I WEREN'T RETIRED,
I, I'D...
如果我没有退休的话
我、我会...

21:21.448 --> 21:23.516
( roaring )
（咆哮）

21:26.353 --> 21:28.488
DO THAT.
这样做。

21:28.521 --> 21:30.690
OUT OF MY WAY, PUNK!
别挡我的路，朋克！

21:30.723 --> 21:32.625
SpongeBob:
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!
海绵宝宝：
我简直不敢相信！

21:32.659 --> 21:34.093
I RODE IN
THE INVISIBLE BOATMOBILE
我骑了进去
隐形移动船

21:34.126 --> 21:38.465
MET A VILLAIN AND LEARNED
TO TREAT THIRD-DEGREE BURNS,
ALL IN ONE DAY.
遇见恶棍并学习
治疗三度烧伤，
一切尽在一日之内。

21:38.498 --> 21:39.832
WHAT ARE WE DOING TOMORROW?
明天我们做什么？

21:41.368 --> 21:43.570
UH... SAY, KID,
WHY DON'T YOU
TAKE THIS NICKEL
呃...说吧，孩子，
你为什么不呢？
拿走这个镍币

21:43.603 --> 21:46.939
AND GO OVER THERE
AND SEE IF OUR THEME SONG
IS ON THE JUKEBOX?
到那里去
看看我们的主题曲
在点唱机上吗？

21:46.973 --> 21:47.940
OKAY.
好的。

21:49.476 --> 21:52.011
YOU KNOW, FOR
A PAIN IN THE NECK
你知道，为了
颈部疼痛

21:52.044 --> 21:54.113
HE'S A PRETTY NICE KID.
他是一个非常好的孩子。

21:54.146 --> 21:55.515
LET'S DITCH HIM.
让我们抛弃他吧。

21:55.548 --> 21:56.783
RIGHT BEHIND YOU.
就在您身后。

21:56.816 --> 21:58.451
IT DOESN'T SEEM TO BE HERE.
它似乎不在这里。

21:58.485 --> 22:00.853
OH, IT'S THERE,
ALL RIGHT.
哦，就在那里，
好吧。

22:00.887 --> 22:02.021
KEEP LOOKING.
继续寻找。

22:02.054 --> 22:04.657
DILIGENCE,
DILIGENCE.
勤奋，
勤奋。

22:04.691 --> 22:07.093
AYE-AYE, SIR!
是的，先生！

22:07.126 --> 22:08.761
( both chuckling )
（两人都咯咯地笑）

22:08.795 --> 22:09.929
DAGNABBIT!
该死！

22:09.962 --> 22:11.364
WHAT'S THE MATTER?
怎么了？

22:11.398 --> 22:13.900
WHERE DID WE PARK
THE INVISIBLE BOATMOBILE?
我们把车停在哪里
隐形移动船？

22:15.502 --> 22:17.970
AW, THAT'S THE 15th TIME
I'VE LOOKED.
哇，这是第 15 次了
我看过了。

22:18.004 --> 22:21.841
( in dramatic voice ):
BUT I CAN'T LET MY HEROES DOWN!
（戏剧性的声音）：
但我不能让我的英雄们失望！

22:21.874 --> 22:24.777
BOATMOBILE? WHERE ARE YOU?
移动船？你在哪里？

22:24.811 --> 22:26.613
BARNACLEBOY, I FOUND IT!
藤壶男孩，我找到了！

22:26.646 --> 22:27.580
( starts engine )
（启动发动机）

22:27.614 --> 22:28.748
( sizzling )
（铁板）

22:28.781 --> 22:30.450
( menacing laughter )
（威胁性的笑声）

22:30.483 --> 22:34.020
STILL GETTING BURNED
ON THAT TAILPIPE,
HUH, BARNACLEBOY?
仍然被烧伤
在那个排气管上，
嗯，藤壶男孩？

22:34.053 --> 22:35.622
( laughing )
（笑）

22:35.655 --> 22:37.924
IT'S THE DIRTY BUBBLE!
这是肮脏的泡沫！

22:37.957 --> 22:40.893
IN ALL HIS DIRTY
ROUNDNESS!
在他所有的肮脏之中
圆度！

22:40.927 --> 22:42.495
Both:
OH, NO!
两者：
哦，不！

22:42.529 --> 22:43.663
I FOUND IT!
我找到了！

22:43.696 --> 22:45.532
AND IT'S THE SPECIAL DANCE MIX.
这是特殊的舞蹈组合。

22:45.565 --> 22:48.134
MermaidMan and BarnacleBoy:
HELP! HELP!
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩：
救命！帮助！

22:48.167 --> 22:49.836
( Dirty Bubble laughing )
（脏泡泡笑）

22:49.869 --> 22:50.837
HELP! HELP!
帮助！帮助！

22:50.870 --> 22:52.672
HOLY CRABBY PATTIES!
天哪，蟹肉饼！

22:52.705 --> 22:55.141
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY'S
ARCHNEMESIS!
美人鱼和藤壶男孩
宿敌！

22:55.174 --> 22:56.909
THE DIRTY BUBBLE!
肮脏的泡沫！

22:56.943 --> 22:58.545
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!
我简直不敢相信！

22:58.578 --> 22:59.479
( laughing )
（笑）

22:59.512 --> 23:02.615
YOU CANNOT SAVE THEM,
SPONGE OF MYSTERY!
你无法拯救他们，
神秘的海绵！

23:02.649 --> 23:06.719
THEY ARE TRAPPED BY MY AWESOME
SURFACE TENSION! ( laughs )
他们被我的厉害所困
表面张力！ （笑）

23:06.753 --> 23:09.689
YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND!
YOU'RE MY MOST FAVORITE
SUPERVILLAIN!
你不明白！
你是我最喜欢的
超级恶棍！

23:09.722 --> 23:10.923
CAN I HAVE YOUR AUTOGRAPH?
我可以要你的签名吗？

23:11.791 --> 23:13.660
OH, NO, YOU FOOL!
哦，不，你这个傻瓜！

23:13.693 --> 23:15.428
STAY BACK! THE POINT!
退后！重点！

23:15.462 --> 23:16.763
OOH, OOH, OOH!
噢，噢，噢！

23:16.796 --> 23:19.632
WATCH THE POINT! AAH!
注意重点！啊啊！

23:19.666 --> 23:21.000
( MermaidMan laughs )
（美人鱼男笑）

23:21.033 --> 23:22.569
YOU SAVED US, SON!
你救了我们，儿子！

23:22.602 --> 23:24.604
YEAH, YOU'RE,
YOU'RE A HERO!
是的，你是，
你是英雄！

23:24.637 --> 23:25.572
I AM?
我是？

23:25.605 --> 23:27.807
ARE YOU UP
FOR ANOTHER RIDE
你起来了吗
再次骑行

23:27.840 --> 23:30.577
IN THE INVISIBLE
BOATMOBILE?
在无形之中
移动船？

23:30.610 --> 23:31.811
* OH...
* 哦...

23:31.844 --> 23:33.913
* JINGLE BELLS,
MERMAIDMAN SMELLS *
* 铃儿响叮当，
美人鱼的气味 *

23:33.946 --> 23:35.715
* BARNACLEBOY LAID AN EGG
* 藤壶男孩下了一个蛋

23:35.748 --> 23:44.023
* THE DIRTY BUBBLE POPPED
AND MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
AND SPONGEBOB GOT AWAY! YAY! *
* 肮脏的泡沫破裂了
还有美人鱼和藤壶男孩
海绵宝宝逃跑了！耶！ *

23:44.056 --> 23:45.024
BarnacleBoy:
WATCH OUT.
藤壶男孩：
当心。

